out this handoff; check the records", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "l_disp", "x": 178, "y": 984, "w": 226, "size": 16, "font": "Cutive Mono", "color": "#4a463f", "runs": [["technical dispatch", ""]], "lh": 21.6, "ls": 0.02, "align": "center", "para_gap": 4}, {"id": "l_crew", "x": 196, "y": 1078, "w": 212, "size": 16.5, "lh": 22, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "align": "right", "ls": 0.04, "runs": [["Field crew", ""]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "l_break", "x": 508, "y": 1116, "w": 340, "size": 14.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "sc_font": "IM FELL English SC", "runs": [["Fiber break", "sc"], [" \u00b7 the physical cause of the outage", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "l_r1", "x": -154, "y": 689.0, "w": 460, "h": 18, "size": 12.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "ls": 0.14, "align": "center", "rot": -90, "runs": [["recognition-to-dispatch", ""]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "l_r2", "x": 640, "y": 1074.0, "w": 246, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "align": "right", "ls": 0.04, "runs": [["Dispatch-to-restoration", ""]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "m_tick", "x": 642, "y": 996, "w": 244, "size": 20, "font": "Sue Ellen Francisco", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["The stone was broken here.", ""], ["", "br"], ["Permission was still required below.", ""]], "lh": 22.4, "align": "right", "para_gap": 4}, {"id": "l_route", "x": 618, "y": 366, "w": 300, "size": 15, "lh": 19, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "ls": 0.04, "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["Added, pre-authorized technical route", ""]]}, {"id": "l_route2", "x": 618, "y": 406, "w": 300, "size": 13.5, "lh": 17, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["add before you remove: the old route is kept", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "l_m0", "x": 599.4950246159333, "y": 605.6972399471196, "w": 196, "size": 14.5, "lh": 19, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "align": "right", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["named owner", "i"]]}, {"id": "l_m1", "x": 620.7171940717615, "y": 736.0106180159404, "w": 196, "size": 14.5, "lh": 19, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "align": "right", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["alternate on-call", "i"]]}, {"id": "l_m2", "x": 573.0379261919561, "y": 860.8134750066861, "w": 196, "size": 14.5, "lh": 19, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "align": "right", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["timed fallback", "i"]]}, {"id": "s03", "x": 130, "y": 1236, "w": 740, "size": 23, "font": "IM FELL English", "color": "#1c1813", "ls": 0.01, "runs": [["Do not confuse the shortest path with a path anyone is allowed to take.", ""]], "lh": 31.7, "align": "center", "para_gap": 12}, {"id": "folio", "x": 440, "y": 1568, "w": 120, "size": 12, "lh": 16, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "ls": 0.2, "align": "center", "color": "#6d5f4b", "runs": [["viii", ""]]}], "verso_boxes": [{"id": "rh_l", "x": 56, "y": 28, "w": 420, "size": 13, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "ls": 0.22, "runs": [["Clavicula Matricis", ""]], "color": "#1c1813", "lh": 17}, {"id": "rh_r", "x": 524, "y": 28, "w": 420, "size": 13, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "ls": 0.22, "align": "right", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["Facing record \u00b7 Tabula VIII", ""]], "lh": 17}, {"id": "head", "x": 56, "y": 88, "w": 600, "size": 30, "lh": 36, "font": "IM FELL English", "runs": [["Record of a hypothetical incident", ""]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "stamp", "x": 56, "y": 140, "w": 888, "size": 13.5, "font": "Cutive Mono", "color": "#4a463f", "runs": [["CONTEMPORARY \u00b7 HYPOTHETICAL \u00b7 NOT AN ACCOUNT OF ANY EMPLOYER", ""]], "lh": 18.2, "ls": 0.08, "para_gap": 4}, {"id": "colA", "x": 56, "y": 236, "w": 420, "size": 17.5, "lh": 24.5, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "sc_font": "IM FELL DW Pica SC", "para_gap": 9, "color": "#1c1813", "runs": [["A hypothetical network operations incident, not an account of any employer. A fiber cut causes an outage. Repair waits because the escalation matrix routes approval through non-technical executives, two of whom are in conflict.", "i"], ["", "br"], ["Inference:", "sc red"], [" locate the break, verify alarms, arrange access, estimate repair time.", ""], ["", "br"], ["Criticism:", "sc red"], [" rebuild the timeline. When was the diagnosis available, which authorization was missing, and what evidence supports the claim of obstruction?", ""], ["", "br"], ["Constitution:", "sc red"], [" why does rank rather than technical competence control dispatch, and who can change that rule?", ""], ["", "br"], ["Audits.", "sc red"], [" Map customers, field crews, carrier partners, technicians and executives, keeping responsibility, expertise and control separate. A technician who cannot safely challenge a manager is part of the model, not a personality defect. \u201cFast escalation\u201d as a measure can reward notifying executives while repairs wait.", ""]]}, {"id": "colB", "x": 524, "y": 236, "w": 420, "size": 17.5, "lh": 24.5, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "sc_font": "IM FELL DW Pica SC", "para_gap": 9, "color": "#1c1813", "runs": [["Measure.", "sc red"], [" Split diagnosis-to-dispatch from dispatch-to-restoration. The first is organizational delay; the second is mostly physical repair. This split is the most directly testable idea in the practice, and regulator investigations of outages often carry timelines detailed enough to apply it.", ""]]}, {"id": "m_measure", "x": 534, "y": 406.64, "w": 400, "size": 21, "font": "Sue Ellen Francisco", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["Timestamp boundaries, not causal partitions. Technical work can sit above the tick; access, authorization, supply or coordination can wait below it.", ""]], "lh": 23.5, "para_gap": 4}, {"id": "colB2", "x": 524, "y": 499.6, "w": 420, "size": 17.5, "lh": 24.5, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "sc_font": "IM FELL DW Pica SC", "para_gap": 9, "color": "#1c1813", "runs": [["Proposal.", "sc red"], [" Trial standing technical dispatch authority under specified conditions, keeping executive notification, a shared record and independent review. Compare restoration delays and mistaken dispatches by severity. Name who must act on a substantiated obstruction, and with what appeal; popularity, shame and bonuses do not substitute for authority over people and resources.", ""]]}, {"id": "dep_h", "x": 150, "y": 838.8000000000001, "w": 700, "size": 15, "lh": 20, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "ls": 0.12, "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["Deposition of the alternate route", ""]]}, {"id": "dep", "x": 150, "y": 870.8000000000001, "w": 700, "size": 18.5, "lh": 26, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["I was drawn in red after the outage, though the master said I had always been there. They named me bypass. I was not a bypass until someone granted me a key, and I was not a correction until a worker could use me without asking the gate I avoided. The old road remained, as the diagram commanded. Its keeper was still paid.", "i"]]}, {"id": "dep_c", "x": 150, "y": 1005.2800000000001, "w": 700, "size": 19, "font": "IM FELL English", "color": "#1c1813", "ls": 0.01, "runs": [["The old road also carried warnings. These were omitted from the red drawing.", ""]], "lh": 26.2, "para_gap": 10}, {"id": "dep_m", "x": 150, "y": 1046.624, "w": 700, "size": 22, "font": "Sue Ellen Francisco", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["No trial of the red route is entered on this leaf.", ""]], "lh": 24.6, "para_gap": 4}, {"id": "k0", "x": 114, "y": 1370, "w": 190, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["standing: an actor with interests", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "k1", "x": 322, "y": 1370, "w": 190, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["a required gate", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "k2", "x": 534, "y": 1370, "w": 190, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["a centre of decision, contestable", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "k3", "x": 744, "y": 1370, "w": 190, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["an added route; the old one kept", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "k4", "x": 114, "y": 1402, "w": 190, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["unverified attribution", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "k5", "x": 322, "y": 1402, "w": 190, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["conditions beneath", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "k6", "x": 534, "y": 1402, "w": 190, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["the break", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "k7", "x": 744, "y": 1402, "w": 190, "size": 13.5, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "runs": [["a handoff, waiting", "i"]], "color": "#1c1813"}, {"id": "wards", "x": 56, "y": 1460, "w": 888, "size": 13, "lh": 18, "font": "IM FELL DW Pica", "color": "#6d5f4b", "runs": [["Margins of the plate, in the legacy hand: left, \u201cA sketch prompts a claim and never replaces one\u201d; right, \u201cData usefulness is not protocol efficacy.\u201d", "i"]]}]}